---
// Los 5 bonus de la cohorte fundadora.
// Uno por fila, en orden 1 → 5, alternando visual y texto. Cada bonus
// tiene su propia maqueta hecha con CSS (nada de iconos con brillo) y
// el certificado cierra la sección como bonus 5.
const LOGO = 'https://d1yei2z3i6k35z.cloudfront.net/9533860/671a9c9265e23_Logo_Nawar_2.png'
---
<section class="bn-section" data-navbar="light">
  <div class="inner" style="position:relative;z-index:1;">

    <div class="bn-header sr">
      <span class="badge-light">
        <svg class="check-icon" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 6.5l2.5 2.5 5.5-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        Además, de regalo
      </span>
      <h2 class="bn-title">Los 5 bonus de la <span class="bn-accent">cohorte fundadora</span></h2>
      <p class="bn-sub">No pagas nada extra por ellos. Vienen dentro, y son los que hacen que no te quedes a medias.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bn-rows">

      <!-- ── BONUS 1 — Clase semanal en directo ── -->
      <article class="bn-row sr">
        <div class="bn-visual">
          <div class="bn-mock bn-mock--dark">
            <div class="bn-live-top">
              <span class="bn-live-tag"><span class="bn-live-dot"></span>EN DIRECTO</span>
              <span class="bn-live-when">jueves · 19:00</span>
            </div>
            <p class="bn-live-title">Les 4 — Getallen en leeftijd</p>
            <p class="bn-live-teacher">Con tu profesor del módulo 4</p>
            <div class="bn-live-people">
              <span class="bn-face">M</span><span class="bn-face">J</span>
              <span class="bn-face">L</span><span class="bn-face">A</span>
              <span class="bn-face bn-face--more">+18</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bn-live-foot">
              <span class="bn-live-btn">Entrar a la clase</span>
              <span class="bn-live-rec">
                <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                Se graba
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bn-text">
          <span class="bn-num">Bonus 01</span>
          <h3 class="bn-name">Clase semanal online en directo</h3>
          <p class="bn-desc">Cada semana una clase en vivo con un profesor interno de la formación, asignado según el módulo que estés cursando. Y si no puedes conectarte, queda grabada y siempre está a tu disposición.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- ── BONUS 2 — Comunidad ── -->
      <article class="bn-row bn-row--flip sr">
        <div class="bn-visual">
          <div class="bn-mock bn-mock--light">
            <div class="bn-chat-top">
              <span class="bn-chat-name">Comunidad Nawar</span>
              <span class="bn-chat-online"><span class="bn-online-dot"></span>34 en línea</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bn-bubble bn-bubble--in">
              <span class="bn-bubble-who">Lucía</span>
              ¿Alguien sabe cuándo se usa <em>er</em>? Me lío un poco
            </div>
            <div class="bn-bubble bn-bubble--out">
              <span class="bn-bubble-who">Manuel</span>
              A mí me pasaba igual. Mira la lección 6, ahí lo explica con ejemplos
            </div>
            <div class="bn-bubble bn-bubble--in">
              <span class="bn-bubble-who">Carlos</span>
              Justo lo pregunté en la clase del jueves
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bn-text">
          <span class="bn-num">Bonus 02</span>
          <h3 class="bn-name">Comunidad de hispanohablantes</h3>
          <p class="bn-desc">Un grupo privado de personas que están exactamente en tu misma situación. Os apoyáis, compartís dudas y avanzáis juntos en lugar de estudiar en solitario.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- ── BONUS 3 — Ejercicios y lecciones extra ── -->
      <article class="bn-row sr">
        <div class="bn-visual">
          <div class="bn-mock bn-mock--light">
            <div class="bn-ex-top">
              <span class="bn-ex-tag">Práctica extra</span>
              <span class="bn-ex-count">4 de 8</span>
            </div>
            <p class="bn-ex-q">¿Cómo se dice «yo vivo»?</p>
            <div class="bn-ex-opts">
              <span class="bn-opt">Ik heet</span>
              <span class="bn-opt bn-opt--ok">Ik woon
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="bn-opt">Ik werk</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bn-ex-bar"><span style="width:52%"></span></div>
            <p class="bn-ex-note">Repite las veces que quieras</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bn-text">
          <span class="bn-num">Bonus 03</span>
          <h3 class="bn-name">Ejercicios y lecciones extra</h3>
          <p class="bn-desc">Material adicional al temario principal para repasar y practicar todo lo que quieras, tantas veces como necesites hasta que te salga sin pensar.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- ── BONUS 4 — Soporte ── -->
      <article class="bn-row bn-row--flip sr">
        <div class="bn-visual">
          <div class="bn-mock bn-mock--dark">
            <div class="bn-sup-top">
              <span class="bn-sup-tag">TU CONSULTA</span>
              <span class="bn-sup-state"><span class="bn-online-dot"></span>Respondida</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bn-sup-q">No entiendo por qué el verbo se va al final en esta frase</div>
            <div class="bn-sup-a">
              <span class="bn-sup-who">Equipo Nawar</span>
              Porque es una subordinada con <em>omdat</em>. Te lo explico paso a paso y te dejo tres ejemplos más.
            </div>
            <p class="bn-sup-foot">Respondido en menos de 24 h</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bn-text">
          <span class="bn-num">Bonus 04</span>
          <h3 class="bn-name">Soporte y resolución de dudas</h3>
          <p class="bn-desc">Cuando algo no te cuadra, preguntas y te respondemos. Sin quedarte bloqueado una semana entera con la misma duda ni buscar respuestas sueltas por internet.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- ── BONUS 5 — Certificado ── -->
      <article class="bn-row bn-row--cert sr">
        <div class="bn-visual">
          <div class="bn-cert-halo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="bn-cert" aria-label="Certificado Holandés Nawar">
            <div class="bn-cert-sheen" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="bn-cert-border">
              <span class="bn-corner bn-corner--tl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="bn-corner bn-corner--tr" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="bn-corner bn-corner--bl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="bn-corner bn-corner--br" aria-hidden="true"></span>

              <div class="bn-cert-head">
                <img src={LOGO} alt="Holandés Nawar" class="bn-cert-logo" width="120" height="30" />
              </div>
              <p class="bn-cert-kicker">— CERTIFICADO DE FINALIZACIÓN —</p>
              <p class="bn-cert-course">Formación Neerlandés A0 → A1</p>
              <p class="bn-cert-grant">Se otorga a</p>
              <div class="bn-cert-nameline">
                <span class="bn-cert-name">Tu nombre</span>
              </div>
              <p class="bn-cert-text">por completar con éxito el programa completo del Método Holandés Nawar</p>
              <div class="bn-cert-foot">
                <div class="bn-cert-sig">
                  <span class="bn-cert-sigline"></span>
                  <span class="bn-cert-siglabel">Director académico</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bn-cert-level">A1</div>
                <div class="bn-cert-seal-wrap">
                  <span class="bn-cert-seal-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <div class="bn-cert-seal">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bn-text">
          <span class="bn-num">Bonus 05</span>
          <h3 class="bn-name">Certificado oficial Holandés Nawar</h3>
          <p class="bn-desc">Al completar todos los módulos recibes tu certificado personalizado con tu nombre, que acredita tu paso de A0 a A1. Tu nivel, demostrado y listo para compartir.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   Sección
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.bn-section { background: #F0F4FF; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 96px 0; }
.bn-header { text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 64px; }
.bn-title {
  font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 46px);
  font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.022em; line-height: 1.12;
  color: #101336; margin-top: 18px;
}
.bn-accent { color: #025dc7; }
.bn-sub { font-size: clamp(14px, 1.4vw, 17px); color: #5A6480; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 14px; }

/* ── Filas: visual + texto, alternando lado ── */
.bn-rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 30px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
.bn-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 40px;
  align-items: center;
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid #E4EAF8;
  border-radius: 26px;
  padding: 30px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(29,0,132,0.04);
}
.bn-row--flip .bn-visual { order: 2; }
.bn-row--flip .bn-text   { order: 1; }

.bn-visual { position: relative; min-width: 0; }
.bn-text   { min-width: 0; }

.bn-num {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #025dc7;
  background: #E8F0FF;
  border-radius: 7px;
  padding: 5px 11px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.bn-name {
  font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(19px, 2.1vw, 24px);
  font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.018em; line-height: 1.22;
  color: #101336; margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.bn-desc { font-size: 15px; color: #5A6480; line-height: 1.68; }

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   Maquetas — planas, sin brillos de color
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.bn-mock {
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 20px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px;
}
.bn-mock--dark {
  background: #1D0084;
  background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.055) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 24px 24px;
  color: #fff;
}
.bn-mock--light { background: #F7F9FF; border: 1px solid #E4EAF8; }

/* Bonus 1 — clase en vivo */
.bn-live-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
.bn-live-tag {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  color: #ffd9d9; background: rgba(255,86,86,0.16);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,86,86,0.34);
  padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px;
}
.bn-live-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff5656; flex-shrink: 0; }
.bn-live-when { font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
.bn-live-title {
  font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
  font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; line-height: 1.3;
}
.bn-live-teacher { font-size: 12.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); margin-top: -5px; }
.bn-live-people { display: flex; align-items: center; }
.bn-face {
  width: 27px; height: 27px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: #3f6ff0; border: 2px solid #1D0084;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;
  margin-right: -7px; flex-shrink: 0;
}
.bn-face--more { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16); font-size: 9.5px; width: 30px; }
.bn-live-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 3px; }
.bn-live-btn {
  font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #1D0084;
  background: #4da3ff; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 9px;
}
.bn-live-rec {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
  font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); font-weight: 600;
}

/* Bonus 2 — comunidad */
.bn-chat-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
.bn-chat-name { font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #101336; }
.bn-chat-online {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #16a34a; white-space: nowrap;
}
.bn-online-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #16a34a; flex-shrink: 0; }
.bn-bubble {
  font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #3A4460;
  padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 12px; max-width: 88%;
}
.bn-bubble em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; color: #025dc7; }
.bn-bubble-who { display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #8A93AB; margin-bottom: 2px; }
.bn-bubble--in { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E4EAF8; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; align-self: flex-start; }
.bn-bubble--out { background: #1D0084; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; align-self: flex-end; }
.bn-bubble--out .bn-bubble-who { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
.bn-bubble--out em { color: #7dbcff; }

/* Bonus 3 — ejercicios */
.bn-ex-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
.bn-ex-tag {
  font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #025dc7; background: #E8F0FF; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; white-space: nowrap;
}
.bn-ex-count { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #8A93AB; white-space: nowrap; }
.bn-ex-q { font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #101336; }
.bn-ex-opts { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }
.bn-opt {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px;
  font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; color: #5A6480;
  background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E4EAF8;
  padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 10px;
}
.bn-opt--ok {
  color: #15803d; font-weight: 700;
  background: rgba(22,163,74,0.07); border-color: rgba(22,163,74,0.30);
}
.bn-ex-bar { height: 5px; background: #E4EAF8; border-radius: 100px; overflow: hidden; }
.bn-ex-bar span { display: block; height: 100%; background: #4da3ff; border-radius: 100px; }
.bn-ex-note { font-size: 11px; color: #8A93AB; }

/* Bonus 4 — soporte */
.bn-sup-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
.bn-sup-tag { font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
.bn-sup-state { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #6ee7a0; white-space: nowrap; }
.bn-sup-state .bn-online-dot { background: #6ee7a0; }
.bn-sup-q {
  font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #fff;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.09); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
  padding: 11px 13px; border-radius: 12px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
}
.bn-sup-a {
  font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  background: rgba(77,163,255,0.14); border: 1px solid rgba(77,163,255,0.30);
  padding: 11px 13px; border-radius: 12px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
}
.bn-sup-a em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; color: #9ecdff; }
.bn-sup-who { display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #9ecdff; margin-bottom: 3px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
.bn-sup-foot { font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }

/* ══ Certificado — estilos originales de nawar-web ══ */
.bn-cert-num {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
  font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4da3ff, #0b6df0);
  padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 6px; margin-right: 7px;
  vertical-align: 1px;
}
/* ── Certificado ── */
.bn-cert-col { position: relative; }
.bn-cert-halo {
  position: absolute; inset: -12% -14%;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(11,109,240,0.14) 0%, transparent 62%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.bn-cert {
  position: relative;
  background: #1D0084; border-radius: 24px; padding: 15px;
  box-shadow: 0 34px 80px rgba(29,0,132,0.30), 0 4px 14px rgba(29,0,132,0.16);
  transform: rotate(-1.2deg);
  transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1), box-shadow 0.35s ease;
  overflow: hidden;
  background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
    radial-gradient(circle 480px at 100% 0%, rgba(11,109,240,0.42) 0%, transparent 65%),
    radial-gradient(circle 380px at 0% 100%, rgba(11,109,240,0.20) 0%, transparent 65%);
  background-size: 28px 28px, auto, auto;
}
.bn-cert:hover { transform: rotate(0deg) translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 44px 96px rgba(29,0,132,0.36), 0 6px 18px rgba(29,0,132,0.18); }
.bn-cert-sheen {
  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 2;
  background: linear-gradient(115deg, transparent 42%, rgba(255,255,255,0.055) 50%, transparent 58%);
}
.bn-cert-border {
  position: relative;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.24); border-radius: 16px;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  padding: 36px 32px 28px; text-align: center;
}
.bn-corner { position: absolute; width: 16px; height: 16px; opacity: 0.75; }
.bn-corner--tl { top: 8px; left: 8px; border-top: 2px solid #4da3ff; border-left: 2px solid #4da3ff; border-top-left-radius: 6px; }
.bn-corner--tr { top: 8px; right: 8px; border-top: 2px solid #4da3ff; border-right: 2px solid #4da3ff; border-top-right-radius: 6px; }
.bn-corner--bl { bottom: 8px; left: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #4da3ff; border-left: 2px solid #4da3ff; border-bottom-left-radius: 6px; }
.bn-corner--br { bottom: 8px; right: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #4da3ff; border-right: 2px solid #4da3ff; border-bottom-right-radius: 6px; }
.bn-cert-logo { height: 34px; margin: 0 auto 18px; display: block; }
.bn-cert-kicker { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.30em; color: #4da3ff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.bn-cert-course {
  font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
  font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.bn-cert-grant { font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.40); margin-bottom: 10px; }
.bn-cert-nameline { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.30); max-width: 260px; margin: 0 auto 8px; padding-bottom: 7px; }
.bn-cert-name {
  font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  font-size: 24px; font-style: italic; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
}
.bn-cert-text { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); line-height: 1.55; max-width: 300px; margin: 0 auto 26px; }
.bn-cert-foot { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; }
.bn-cert-sig { text-align: left; }
.bn-cert-sigline { display: block; width: 110px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); margin-bottom: 5px; }
.bn-cert-siglabel { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
.bn-cert-level {
  font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22); border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 4px 13px; margin-bottom: 4px;
}
@media (max-width: 400px) {
 .bn-cert-level { display: none; }
}
.bn-cert-seal-wrap { position: relative; width: 56px; height: 56px; }
.bn-cert-seal-ring {
  position: absolute; inset: -5px;
  border: 1px dashed rgba(77,163,255,0.55); border-radius: 50%;
}
.bn-cert-seal {
  width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4da3ff, #0b6df0);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: none;
}
.bn-cert-caption { text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 14.5px; color: #101336; position: relative; }

/* ── Fila del certificado: algo más de aire ── */
.bn-row--cert { padding: 34px 30px; }

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   Responsive
